---
import SocialList from "@/components/SocialList.astro";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<PageLayout meta={{ title: "Home" }}>
  <section>

    <!-- The name is shown in the header; this heading is for screen readers and search engines -->
    <h1 class="sr-only">Yathi Rajavalli Kasturi Kandalam</h1>

    <!-- Role -->
    <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-400 mb-6">
      Pre-Doc · ISI Delhi
    </p>

    <!-- Bio -->
    <p class="mb-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      I am a pre-doctoral researcher at the
      <a href="https://sites.google.com/site/ppruisid/planning-and-policy-research-unit?authuser=0"
        class="text-accent hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity underline decoration-accent/40"
        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Indian Statistical Institute, Delhi</a>. 
        I study how social institutions and access to public services shape individual agency and life outcomes, 
        working with large-scale administrative and spatial data to surface patterns invisible at the aggregate level. 
        My current work at Indian Statistical Institute – Delhi spans healthcare access, health provider choice and education market dynamics. 
 </p>
    <p class="mb-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      I hold an M.A. (2024) and a B.A. (Hons) in Economics from
      <a href="https://azimpremjiuniversity.edu.in/economics"
        class="text-accent hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity underline decoration-accent/40"
        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Azim Premji University</a>.
        I hold an M.A. and B.A. in Economics (Hons) from Azim Premji University. Previously I worked for <a href="https://books.core-econ.org/insights/informality-and-the-capitalist-economy/00-highlights.html"
        class="text-accent hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity underline decoration-accent/40"
        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CORE Economics Education</a>, <a href="https://cse.azimpremjiuniversity.edu.in/"
        class="text-accent hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity underline decoration-accent/40"
        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Centre for Sustainable Employment</a>, and <a href="https://thedocs.worldbank.org/en/doc/771211575476485169-0090022019/render/DEJURENov2019.pdf"
        class="text-accent hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity underline decoration-accent/40"
        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DE JURE, DIME at the World Bank</a> — contributing to projects on labour markets, social protection, and pedagogy in economics. 
        I publish as Kasturi Kandalam.
    </p>

    <!-- Contact + social -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap text-sm mb-2">
      <a href="mailto:kasturi.kandalam@gmail.com"
         class="text-accent font-medium hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity text-[13px]">
        kasturi.kandalam@gmail.com
      </a>
    </div>
    <SocialList />

  </section>

  <!-- Featured paper -->
  <section class="mt-10">

    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <span class="text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest uppercase whitespace-nowrap text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-400">Featured paper</span>
      <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/60"></div>
    </div>

    <article class="border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800/60 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-stone-300 dark:hover:border-stone-700 transition-colors">
      <h3 class="mb-2" style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.4; font-family: 'Georgia', serif;">
        <a href="/kastkan/research/"
           class="text-stone-800 dark:text-amber-50 hover:text-accent dark:hover:text-accent transition-colors">
          Insurance Without Primary Care? Claims, PHC Access, and Universal Health Coverage in India
        </a>
      </h3>
      <p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mb-3">
        Using 582,795 insurance claims from rural Meghalaya, linked to road-network travel times and
        public health centre staffing, this paper finds that a one standard deviation increase in road
        distance to the nearest primary health centre raises mean claim amounts by 2.1%. The presence of
        doctors at health centres lowers claim amounts by more than a comparable reduction in distance would.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-3">
        <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/80 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700/60 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Public health insurance</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/80 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700/60 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Primary care access</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/80 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700/60 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Provider Choice</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-1 text-xs font-medium">
        <a href="mailto:kasturi.kandalam@gmail.com?subject=Draft%20request%3A%20Insurance%20Without%20Primary%20Care"
           class="text-accent hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity">
          Draft available on request →
        </a>
        <a href="/kastkan/research/"
           class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 hover:text-stone-700 dark:hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">
          All research →
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

  </section>

  <!-- Code and tools -->
  <section class="mt-8">

    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <span class="text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest uppercase whitespace-nowrap text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-400">Code and tools</span>
      <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/60"></div>
    </div>

    <article class="border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800/60 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-stone-300 dark:hover:border-stone-700 transition-colors">
      <h3 class="mb-1.5" style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.4;">
        <a href="https://github.com/kasturikandalam/osrm-travel-times"
           class="text-stone-800 dark:text-amber-50 hover:text-accent dark:hover:text-accent transition-colors"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          OSRM Travel Time Tools <span class="text-accent">→</span>
        </a>
      </h3>
      <p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mb-2.5">
        Lightweight Python tools for computing road-network travel times and distances using the Open Source
        Routing Machine API, supporting many-to-many accessibility matrices and pairwise
        origin-destination calculations for development research.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/80 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700/60 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Python</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/80 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700/60 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Spatial data</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/80 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700/60 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">API integration</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800/80 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700/60 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Research tools</span>
      </div>
    </article>

  </section>
</PageLayout>